      "text": "A pause or a shift in tone can linger long after a conversation ends. In returning to a remembered exchange, one can often catch an explanation being quietly added to the memory. An immediate impression and the story formed around it are distinct things, and a feeling can deserve attention even while another person's intentions remain unknown.",
